/K [12]
>>
endobj
579 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 217 0 R
/T (The list design scales because adding a farmer adds data, not code: for 150,000 farmers the same four lines work unchanged and the data can come from a file. The variable design would need 450,000 names typed or generated, cannot be looped over \(variable names cannot be iterated over cleanly\), and must be edited whenever a farmer is added.)
/E (The list design scales because adding a farmer adds data, not code: for 150,000 farmers the same four lines work unchanged and the data can come from a file. The variable design would need 450,000 names typed or generated, cannot be looped over \(variable names cannot be iterated over cleanly\), and must be edited whenever a farmer is added.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
