<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 220 0 R
/T (The result 33400.29999999999857893118278 is wrong. float\("33.40"\) is already the inexact double 33.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375; Decimal\(...\) then copies that value faithfully, so the 1,000 additions add 1,000 copies of the error. The decimal module is exact only if it is given the exact digits, i.e. the original string.)
/E (The result 33400.29999999999857893118278 is wrong. float\("33.40"\) is already the inexact double 33.39999999999999857891452847979962825775146484375; Decimal\(...\) then copies that value faithfully, so the 1,000 additions add 1,000 copies of the error. The decimal module is exact only if it is given the exact digits, i.e. the original string.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [70]
>>
