922 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 224 0 R
/T (4.2, 3.5 and 0.1 are not all exactly representable. 4.2 - 3.5 gives 0.7000000000000002, and dividing by 0.1 gives 7.000000000000002. The step count must be the whole number 7, so the program takes the nearest whole number with round\(\). The brief quotes the value as 7.000000000000001; the exact digits depend on the operands, and the point is the same - the result is not exactly 7.)
/E (4.2, 3.5 and 0.1 are not all exactly representable. 4.2 - 3.5 gives 0.7000000000000002, and dividing by 0.1 gives 7.000000000000002. The step count must be the whole number 7, so the program takes the nearest whole number with round\(\). The brief quotes the value as 7.000000000000001; the exact digits depend on the operands, and the point is the same - the result is not exactly 7.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [24]
>>
