1425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 232 0 R
/T (Local and global names. fat_steps, snf_steps and rate are local: they exist only during a call. The constants \(BASE_RATE, ...\) are global and are only read inside the functions. Assigning to BASE_RATE inside a function would create a new local name that hides the global \(and, if the global is read first in the same function, raises UnboundLocalError\), so the shared rate card would silently stay unchanged.)
/E (Local and global names. fat_steps, snf_steps and rate are local: they exist only during a call. The constants \(BASE_RATE, ...\) are global and are only read inside the functions. Assigning to BASE_RATE inside a function would create a new local name that hides the global \(and, if the global is read first in the same function, raises UnboundLocalError\), so the shared rate card would silently stay unchanged.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [68]
>>
endobj
