1466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 233 0 R
/T (The call overhead is a few percent at most and does not change the complexity: time is O\(n\) for n entries, and the extra space is O\(1\) \(call frames are created and released\). The one-script design is not faster in any way that matters, but every change must be repeated wherever the calculation is copied. Lambdas are acceptable for a short sort key but cannot carry a docstring, are awkward to debug, and cannot hold the validation logic.)
/E (The call overhead is a few percent at most and does not change the complexity: time is O\(n\) for n entries, and the extra space is O\(1\) \(call frames are created and released\). The one-script design is not faster in any way that matters, but every change must be repeated wherever the calculation is copied. Lambdas are acceptable for a short sort key but cannot carry a docstring, are awkward to debug, and cannot hold the validation logic.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [38]
>>
