<<
/Title (Python's round\(\) sends ties to the even digit, while ordinary commercial rounding sends them up. The two give totals that differ by 13, 279 and 6,807 paise \(Rs 68.07 at 150,000 payments\). This is the largest effect measured in this assignment, and it is a policy choice that Python's default makes silently.)
/Dest [46 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5193 0 R
