5293 0 obj
<<
/Title (About 9 % of payments \(13,648 of 150,000\) end in exactly half a paisa, for example a payment of exactly 2.675. Decimal applies a stated rule; float decides by the sign of a hidden binary error \(2.675 is stored as 2.67499999999999982..., so it rounds down\). The program counts the differences that are not ties and finds none: all 6,167 mismatches are ties.)
/Dest [46 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5264 0 R
/Next 5321 0 R
>>
endobj
5294 0 obj
<<
