/Last 5338 0 R
/Count -2
>>
endobj
5311 0 obj
<<
/Title (For fat = 4.2 all three agree only because the raw value happens to lie just above 7; a value just below an integer \(for example 3.8, raw 2.9999999999999982\) makes int\(\) and floor\(\) return 2. Only round\(\) is correct for every reading. Each method is one evaluation: O\(1\) time and O\(1\) space, so the choice is decided by correctness alone.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 5281 0 R
/Next 5339 0 R
>>
