5674 0 obj
<<
/Title (Local and global names. fat_steps, snf_steps and rate are local: they exist only during a call. The constants \(BASE_RATE, ...\) are global and are only read inside the functions. Assigning to BASE_RATE inside a function would create a new local name that hides the global \(and, if the global is read first in the same function, raises UnboundLocalError\), so the shared rate card would silently stay unchanged.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5630 0 R
/Prev 5660 0 R
/Next 5661 0 R
>>
endobj
